WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.590
You wake up at seven in the morning

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.470
and pour yourself a glass of water.

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.350
Your roommate walks into the kitchen,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:06.170
rubs his eyes,

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:06.710
and smiles.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:07.790
Morning.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.190
Did you sleep well,

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:09.570
he asks.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.050
Yeah, slept like a rock,

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:12.570
you reply.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.590
And right above your lips,

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.930
a bright crimson box flashes:

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:18.230
Lie.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.510
Rated eighty-four percent.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.590
You freeze.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.010
Your roommate looks at the

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.130
breakfast you made and says,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.710
thanks, this tastes amazing.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.830
Floating right above his mouth in bold red letters:

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:31.830
Lie.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.010
He thinks it is cold and bland.
